  "details": "After the recent IK 2.0 update (5/25/2022) I noticed my avatar has broken eyes (appears \"derpy\" with one eyeball up and the other down). I had used some custom eye Rotation States under the Avatar Descriptor to keep my eyeballs from rolling into the back of my head but still have tiny subtle movements to avoid the dead eyes look. After importing the latest SDK, the rotations still appear and work correctly in Unity, but are messed up in VRChat when the new IK is enabled. If I switch back to legacy IK, the avatar is fine again.",
